Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back. Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for the dark theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Willow Chest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is, the story of a family living a hard life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to sell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I can't buy rice for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.35,0:00:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.11,0:00:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Udajii.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Udajii/Old Uda (うだじい): A localized term for a protector spirit that inhabits the family's traditional willow chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But, it's something precious that you brought,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,when got married, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.23,0:00:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:00:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go back to my parents' home for Obon festival this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,i wonder if dad's doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been home in a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,i miss the river i used to play in when i was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go back to that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom is talking to Old Uda again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Uda,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.14,0:01:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm with Old Uda,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom looks happy when she's with Old Uda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Uda,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I also have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it have to be Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tae-san
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've decided well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure it's okay to sell old Uda?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Something terrible is happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you bringing it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you go around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This was for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it would have turned into a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Misfortune would come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please continue to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Uda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The END
